msgstr "Nije dostupno u ovoj sesiji."

msgid "Steam games"
msgstr "Steam igre"

msgid ""
"Turns on while Steam runs a game: Steam starts every game through reaper "
"SteamLaunch, and game windows have the ID steam_app_<number>."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje se dok Steam pokreće igru: Steam pokreće svaku igru ​​kroz reaper "
"SteamLaunch, a prozori igre imaju ID steam_app_<number>."

msgid "Turns on while Steam reports a running game."
msgstr "Uključuje se dok Steam prijavljuje pokrenutu igru."

msgid "Lutris games"
msgstr "Lutris igre"

msgid ""
"Turns on while a game started by Lutris runs: Lutris starts every game "
"through lutris-wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje se dok radi igra koju je pokrenuo Lutris: Lutris pokreće svaku "
"igru ​​kroz lutris-wrapper."

msgid "Gamescope sessions"
msgstr "Gamescope sesije"

